# transactionCode: the one returned when creating it (creation.http) or by the queries (query.http).
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api/v1/transaction
@customerToken = PASTE_TOKEN_FROM_auth.http
@adminToken = PASTE_TOKEN_FROM_auth.http
@transactionCode = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Cancel, PENDING only: account-service undoes it if it was applied (REVERSED) or blocks the key (CANCELLED) (owner CUSTOMER_BASIC or ADMIN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{transactionCode}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Reverse, COMPLETED only: returns the money; 409 if the target account no longer has it (ADMIN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{transactionCode}}/reverse
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
